{
  "id": "float_glass___weight_vs__thickness",
  "title": "Float Glass - Weight vs. Thickness",
  "description": "Weight of float glass. Float glass is a sheet of glass made by floating molten glass on a bed of molten metal.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Float Glass - Weight vs. Thickness\n\nCalculate or reference the weight of float glass based on its thickness.\n\n**Note:** Float glass is a sheet of glass made by floating molten glass on a bed of molten metal."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "thickness",
          "label": "Thickness",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "mm",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "area",
          "label": "Area",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m²",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "weight_per_m2",
          "label": "Weight per m²",
          "unit": "kg/m²",
          "formula": "inputs.thickness * 2.5",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_weight",
          "label": "Total Weight",
          "unit": "kg",
          "formula": "(inputs.thickness * 2.5) * inputs.area",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Thickness (mm)",
        "Weight (kg/m²)"
      ],
